        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Bench version complete</strong><p>
            Firmware on the ESP32 reads two probes, recovers from restarts, finds a probe that moved and uploads to the
            cloud. Updates arrive over Wi-Fi. The Probe Service tool covers scanning, addressing and calibration.
          </p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Connect and observe</strong><p>
            Bury both probes, check readings in soil and calibrate pH and moisture. Then compare both garden locations
            and review watering thresholds.
          </p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Add automatic irrigation</strong><p>
            Only after reliable monitoring: test a valve, shut-off behaviour and watering limits. Weather and
            notifications are available in the app; automatic irrigation remains future work.
          </p>
        </li>
      </ol>
